{:itonami.blueprint/id "cloud-itonami-iso3166-mdv"
 :itonami.blueprint/name "Independent Public-Sector Market-Entry & Procurement Compliance Service — Maldives"
 :itonami.blueprint/iso3166 "MDV"
 :itonami.blueprint/domain :public-sector/market-entry-compliance
 :itonami.blueprint/license "AGPL-3.0-or-later"
 :itonami.blueprint/governor :market-entry-compliance-governor
 :itonami.blueprint/robotics false
 :itonami.blueprint/required-technologies [:identity :forms :dmn :bpmn :audit-ledger]
 :itonami.blueprint/status :public-oss
 :itonami.blueprint/maturity :implemented
 :itonami.blueprint/implemented-slice
 "src/marketentry/{facts,governor,store,registry,marketentryllm,operation,phase,sim}.cljc
  -- MarketEntry-LLM (mock advisor) sealed behind a langgraph-clj
  StateGraph (intake -> advise -> govern -> decide -> [request-approval] ->
  commit|hold), censored by a 7-check Market-Entry Compliance Governor
  (spec-basis, evidence-incomplete, mdv-registration-missing [flagship],
  engagement-fee-mismatch, mira-registration-unverified,
  confidence-floor/actuation-gate, already-drafted/already-submitted),
  Store protocol with MemStore + DatomicStore (built on
  io.github.kotoba-lang/langchain-store, not a hand-rolled enc/dec*
  codec), 0->3 phase rollout gate, and an append-only audit ledger.
  `:filing/draft`/`:filing/submit` never auto-commit at any phase.
  Facts catalog (src/marketentry/facts.cljc) is grounded exclusively in
  the verified MDV dossier: the Ministry of Finance (and Public
  Enterprises, https://www.finance.gov.mv/public-finance/legislation),
  the Public Finance Regulation (issued by the Ministry of Finance,
  governs public-finance/procurement processes and requirements), the
  Business Registration Act -- Law No. 18/2014
  (business.egov.mv), and the Maldives Inland Revenue Authority (MIRA,
  responsible for tax administration and implementation of taxation
  policy). No national e-procurement portal and no specific SME-
  threshold monetary value are claimed -- neither was independently
  verified. Test suite: test/marketentry/{facts,governor_contract,
  store_contract,registry,phase}_test.clj -- one test per governor
  rule, MemStore ≡ DatomicStore parity, pure-function registry
  coverage, and full StateGraph end-to-end exercise for both a commit
  path (clean-intake-auto-commits) and a hold path
  (fabricated-jurisdiction-is-held / the 4 HARD-hold rule tests)."}
